{{ 'section-jf-coustom-dress-picker.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- style -%}
  #JfCoustomDressPicker-{{ section.id }} {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.background_color }};
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
  }

  #JfCoustomDressPicker-{{ section.id }} .jf-coustom-dress-picker__inner {
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
  }

  #JfCoustomDressPicker-{{ section.id }} .jf-coustom-dress-picker__button {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.button_background_color }};
    color: {{ section.settings.button_text_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    #JfCoustomDressPicker-{{ section.id }} .jf-coustom-dress-picker__inner {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top_desktop }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom_desktop }}px;
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<section id="JfCoustomDressPicker-{{ section.id }}" class="jf-coustom-dress-picker">
  <div class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__inner page-width">
    {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank or section.settings.heading != blank or section.settings.intro != blank -%}
      <div class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__header">
        {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
          <p class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
          <h2 class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.intro != blank -%}
          <div class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__intro rte">{{ section.settings.intro }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__grid">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          <article class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <div class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__media">
              {%- if block.settings.image != blank -%}
                {{
                  block.settings.image
                  | image_url: width: 900
                  | image_tag:
                    widths: '375, 550, 750, 900',
                    sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 31vw, (min-width: 750px) 33vw, 100vw',
                    loading: 'lazy',
                    alt: block.settings.image.alt
                }}
              {%- else -%}
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg' }}
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

            {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
              <h3 class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__item-heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h3>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if block.settings.subheading != blank -%}
              <div class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__item-subheading rte">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
              <div class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__item-text rte">{{ block.settings.text }}</div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </article>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.footer_heading != blank or section.settings.footer_text != blank or section.settings.button_label != blank -%}
      <div class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__footer-panel">
        {%- if section.settings.footer_heading != blank -%}
          <h3 class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__footer-heading">{{ section.settings.footer_heading | escape }}</h3>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.footer_text != blank -%}
          <div class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__footer-text rte">{{ section.settings.footer_text }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.button_label != blank -%}
          <div class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__button-wrap">
            <a
              {% if section.settings.button_link != blank %}
                href="{{ section.settings.button_link }}"
              {% else %}
                role="link" aria-disabled="true"
              {% endif %}
              class="jf-coustom-dress-picker__button"
            >
              <span>{{ section.settings.button_label | escape }}</span>
              <span class="svg-wrapper">{{ 'icon-arrow.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "JF Coustom Dress Picker",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Top content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow",
      "default": "DEFINING THE JULIE SUFI BRIDE"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Is a Custom Wedding Dress Right for You?"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "Intro text",
      "default": "<p>A departure from the traditional, a couture commission is an investment in both time and self-expression. A Julie Sufi gown is not found-it is forged. While every bride is unique, those who enter our atelier are typically driven by one of three distinct motivations.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Footer content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "footer_heading",
      "label": "Footer heading",
      "default": "The Julie Sufi Distinction"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "footer_text",
      "label": "Footer text",
      "default": "<p>Whether you are driven by vision, fit, or legacy, the result is a singular, non-replicated work of art that belongs exclusively to you.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_label",
      "label": "Button label",
      "default": "BOOK YOUR DESIGN DIALOGUE SLOT"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "button_link",
      "label": "Button link"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Colors"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Section background",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Font color",
      "default": "#232128"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_background_color",
      "label": "Button background",
      "default": "#1f1f23"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_text_color",
      "label": "Button text",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top_mobile",
      "label": "Mobile top padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom_mobile",
      "label": "Mobile bottom padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 44
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top_desktop",
      "label": "Desktop top padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 240,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 24
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom_desktop",
      "label": "Desktop bottom padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 240,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dress_type",
      "name": "Image box",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "Image"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "label": "Heading",
          "default": "The Visionary"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "subheading",
          "label": "Bold intro",
          "default": "<p><strong>For the bride who seeks a singular aesthetic.</strong></p>"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Text",
          "default": "<p>If you find the standard bridal offering repetitive, you are likely looking for a designer to translate a specific aesthetic soul into a physical reality. You value the creative dialogue of the process and refuse to settle for a design that already exists. For you, the bespoke wedding gown is a canvas for an original story.</p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "JF Coustom Dress Picker",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "dress_type",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Visionary",
            "subheading": "<p><strong>For the bride who seeks a singular aesthetic.</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>If you find the standard bridal offering repetitive, you are likely looking for a designer to translate a specific aesthetic soul into a physical reality. You value the creative dialogue of the process and refuse to settle for a design that already exists. For you, the bespoke wedding gown is a canvas for an original story.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "dress_type",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Perfectionist",
            "subheading": "<p><strong>For the bride who prioritises the mathematics of fit.</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>You understand that true elegance is a derivative of architecture. If you have struggled with standard sizing or simply demand a garment that moves in total harmony with your skin, you seek the security of our Toile prototype dress. You require a gown sculpted for your specific geometry to ensure effortless poise.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "dress_type",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Heritage-Seeker",
            "subheading": "<p><strong>For the bride who views her gown as a landmark.</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>You see a wedding gown as a piece of your family history rather than a single-day garment. Drawn to Julie Sufi's three generations of lineage, you value the heritage techniques and master-craftsmanship that ensure your handmade wedding dress remains a preserved masterpiece for decades to come.</p>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
